oc ferit de soare, uscat Ĺi rĂŁcoros.   <br />Termen de garanĹŁie: ĂŽn ambalajul original Ĺi condiĹŁiile de   <br />depozitare 18 luni de la data fabricaĹŁiei.  <br /></span></span>\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t</td>  \t\t\t\t\t\t<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><img src=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/img/product/product_photo11.jpg\" width=\"230\" /></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n</div><br />    <br />\n<br />\n<!-- AddThis Button BEGIN -->\n<div class=\"addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style addthis_32x32_style\">\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_1\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_2\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_3\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_4\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_compact\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style\"></a>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- AddThis Button END --></td>\n    <td id=\"right\">\n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"table_right\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"images/main_calendar.jpg\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" alt=\"\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#7EB1EB\" id=\"table_right_content\">\n    <div class='right_title' align='center' style='text-transform:uppercase;'>Octombrie</div><div style=\"padding-bottom:5px; padding-top:5px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"border-top:#FFFFFF 1px dotted; padding-bottom:5px; padding-top:5px;\"></div><a href=\"showarticle.php?articleID=184\" class=\"link_white\" style=\"text-transform:capitalize; font-weight:bold;\">Octombrie</a></div><div align=\"justify\" style=\"font-size:10px;\">\r Plante de Exterior                       \tCulesul strugurilor                       \t                       \t                      \tPlante de Interior                       \tPregatirea plantelor pentru iarna       In viata romanilor, nu de multa vreme a luat nastere o zicala: iarna  nu-i ca vara.</div><div style=\"padding-top:5px;\" align=\"right\"><a href=\"showarticle.php?articleID=184\" class=\"link_white\" style=\"fo