u</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=76\" class=\"blink10u\">Ailanthus altissima</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=77\" class=\"blink10u\">Albizia</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=78\" class=\"blink10u\">Amygdalus</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=79\" class=\"blink10u\">Mesteacan</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=80\" class=\"blink10u\">Carpen</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=81\" class=\"blink10u\">Castan</a>,  </span><span class=\"btext10\"><a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=82\" class=\"blink10u\">Catalpa</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=83\" class=\"blink10u\">Celtis, Sambovina</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=84\" class=\"blink10u\">Cires</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=85\" class=\"blink10u\">Arborele lui Iuda</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=86\" class=\"blink10u\">Alun turcesc</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=87\" class=\"blink10u\">Cydonia</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=88\" class=\"blink10u\">Eleagnus</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=89\" class=\"blink10u\">Fag</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=outdoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=90\" class=\"blink10u\">Fraxin</a>, <a href=\"http://www.pl