    "content": "Granule de argilă - Gama FLORIMO Cod: 5999500434130 Descriere : Granulele de argilă sunt folosite atât ca decorațiuni la plantele În ghivece cât și ca drenaj În fundul ghiveciului sau ca substrat pentru evaporarea apei În farfurioara ghiveciului la plantele care necesită umiditate ridicată. Grad de toxicitate: nu este toxic. Interzis aruncarea ambalajului În lacuri sau râuri. Nu este inflamabil, cat. E. Depozitare: la loc ferit de soare, uscat și răco ros. Produs recomandat pentru planta: Crin verde, clorofitum , Croton , Planta grasa , Begonia , Palmier de camera , Floarea flamingo , Araucaria , Begonia , Ananas , Ctenante, Afelandra , Ecmea , Aloe, sabur , Aglaonema , Cicas , Ciclamen , Ciperus , Diefenbahia , Dracena Ambalaje: 5 l",
    "html": "<br /><br><div align=\"justify\">\r\n<table><tbody><tr><td class=\"otext12b\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"100%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Granule de argilÄ  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t- Gama FLORIMO<br /></span></span></span></span></span><img src=\"file:///c:/docume%7e1/mathea%7e1/locals%7e1/temp/moz-screenshot-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"file:///c:/docume%7e1/mathea%7e1/locals%7e1/temp/moz-screenshot-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"file:///c:/docume%7e1/mathea%7e1/locals%7e1/temp/moz-screenshot-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span class=\"text10b\"> Cod: </span><span class=\"btext10\">5999500434130</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span class=\"text10b\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Descriere</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span class=\"text10b\">: </span></span><span class=\"btext10\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">  Granulele de</span> <span style=\"font-size: small;\">argilÄ</span> <span style=\"font-size: small;\">sunt  folosite atĂ˘t ca decoraĹŁiuni la plantele ĂŽn ghivece cĂ˘t Ĺi ca drenaj ĂŽn  fundul ghiveciului sau ca substrat pentru evaporarea apei ĂŽn  farfurioara ghiveciului la plantele care necesitÄ umiditate ridicatÄ. </span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Grad de toxicitate: nu este toxic. Interzis aruncarea ambalajului ĂŽn lacuri sau rĂ˘uri.  </span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Nu este inflamabil, cat. E.  </span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Depozitare: la loc ferit de soare, uscat</span> <span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ĺi</span> <span style=\"font-size: small;\">rÄco</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ros. <br /><br /></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span class=\"text10b\"> <span style=\"font-size: small;\">Produs recomandat pentru planta: </span></span><span class=\"btext10\"><a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=64\" class=\"blink10u\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Crin verde, clorofitum</span></a><span style=\"font-size: small;\">, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=65\" class=\"blink10u\">Croton</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=66\" class=\"blink10u\">Planta grasa</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=61\" class=\"blink10u\">Begonia</a>, </span><a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=63\" class=\"blink10u\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Palmier de camera</span></a><span style=\"font-size: small;\">, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=56\" class=\"blink10u\">Floarea flamingo</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=58\" class=\"blink10u\">Araucaria</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=60\" class=\"blink10u\">Begonia</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=55\" class=\"blink10u\">Ananas</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=67\" class=\"blink10u\">Ctenante, </a></span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=57\" class=\"blink10u\">Afelandra</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=49\" class=\"blink10u\">Ecmea</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=52\" class=\"blink10u\">Aloe, sabur</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=51\" class=\"blink10u\">Aglaonema</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=68\" class=\"blink10u\">Cicas</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=69\" class=\"blink10u\">Ciclamen</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=70\" class=\"blink10u\">Ciperus</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=71\" class=\"blink10u\">Diefenbahia</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=72\" class=\"blink10u\">Dracena</a><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /><br /><span class=\"text10b\"> Ambalaje: </span><span class=\"btext10\">5 l</span></span><br /><br /></span></span></span></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t</td>  \t\t\t\t\t</tr>  \t\t\t\t\t<tr>  \t\t\t\t\t\t<td>  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span class=\"btext10\"> <br /></span></span></span></span>\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t</td>  \t\t\t\t\t\t<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><img src=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/img/product/product_photo12.jpg\" width=\"230\" /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span></span></span><img src=\"file:///c:/docume%7e1/mathea%7e1/locals%7e1/temp/moz-screenshot-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><br /></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n</div><br />    <br />\n<br />\n<!-- AddThis Button BEGIN -->\n<div class=\"addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style addthis_32x32_style\">\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_1\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_2\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_3\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_preferred_4\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_button_compact\"></a>\n<a class=\"addthis_counter addthis_bubble_style\"></a>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- AddThis Button END --></td>\n    <td id=\"right\">\n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"table_right\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"images/main_calendar.jpg\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" alt=\"\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#7EB1EB\" id=\"table_right_content\">\n    <div class='right_title' align='center' style='text-transform:uppercase;'>Octombrie</div><div style=\"padding-bottom:5px; padding-top:5px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"border-top:#FFFFFF 1px dotted; padding-bottom:5px; padding-top:5px;\"></div><a href=\"showarticle.php?articleID=184\" class=\"link_white\" style=\"text-transform:capitalize; font-weight:bold;\">Octombrie</a></div><div align=\"justify\" style=\"font-size:10px;\">\r Plante de Exterior                       \tCulesul strugurilor                       \t                       \t                      \tPlante de Interior                       \tPregatirea plantelor pentru iarna       In viata romanilor, nu de multa vreme a luat nastere o zicala: iarna  nu-i ca vara.</div><div style=\"padding-top:5px;\" align=\"right\"><a href=\"showarticle.php?articleID=184\" class=\"link_white\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">citeste mai mult ...</a></div></p>"
