r, de   balcon, arbori, arbuĹti, etc.  <br />ĂŽn timpul lucrului evitaĹŁi contactul pĂŁmĂ˘ntului cu ochii, gura   sau rĂŁni deschise. Ăn caz contrar, clÄtiĹŁi imediat cu apĂŁ . Ăn caz   de alergie sau infecĹŁie trebuie acordat primul ajutor Ĺi   <br />asistentĂŁ medicalĂŁ.   <br />Grad de toxicitate: nu este toxic.  <br /> Interzis aruncarea   <br />ambalajului ĂŽn lacuri sau rĂ˘uri.   <br />Nu este inflamabil, cat. E.   <br />Depozitare: la loc ferit de soare, uscat Ĺi rĂŁcoros   <br />Termen de garanĹŁie: ĂŽn ambalajul original Ĺi condiĹŁiile de   depozitare 18 luni d<span style=\"font-size: small;\">e la data fabric</span>aĹŁiei.</span></span>\t\t\t\t\t  \t\t\t\t\t\t</td>  \t\t\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/img/product/product_photo34.jpg\" width=\"230\" /><br />  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t <img src=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/img/framework/spacer.png\" vspace=\"5\" /> </td></tr></tbody></table><br /><br /></td>  \t\t\t\t\t</tr>  \t\t\t\t\t<tr>  \t\t\t\t\t\t<td>  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: small;\"></span><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text10b\"> Produs recomandat pentru planta: </span><span class=\"btext10\"><a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=64\" class=\"blink10u\">Crin verde, clorofitum</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=65\" class=\"blink10u\">Croton</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=66\" class=\"blink10u\">Planta grasa</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=61\" class=\"blink10u\">Begonia</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=63\" class=\"blink10u\">Palmier de camera</a>, <a href=\"http://www.planteonline.ro/index.php?pn=indoor_plant_detailed_box&amp;id_plant=56\" class=\"blink10u\">Floarea flamingo</a>, <